# _td_help - help text generation library
# This file body becomes the function body via autoload

_td_show_help() {
  cat <<'HELP'
todo - Task manager for the terminal

Usage: todo <command> [options]

Commands:
  board                      Show kanban board view (default)
  bulk done|move|rm <ids>    Bulk operations on multiple tasks
  add [-p prio] [-t tag] <title>  Add a new task
  ls [-s status] [-p prio]   List tasks (with optional filters)
  edit <id> <title>          Edit task title
  rm <id>                    Remove a task
  done <id>                  Mark task as completed
  move <id> <status>         Move task to a status (todo, doing, done)
  priority <id> <value>      Set priority (alta, media, baixa)
  status                     List statuses for current list
  status add <name>          Add a custom status
  status rm <name>           Remove a status (no tasks must use it)
  tag add <id> <tag>         Add a tag to a task
  tag rm <id> <tag>          Remove a tag from a task
  archive                    Archive completed tasks
  archive ls                 List archived tasks
  archive undo <id>          Restore archived task to active list
  list                       List all lists
  list create <name>         Create a new list
  list switch <name>         Switch active list
  help                       Show this help message
  version                    Show version

Run 'todo help <command>' for command-specific help.
HELP
}
